---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Terms of Service — Behind the Door Podcast"
  description="Terms of Service for Behind the Door podcast website."
>
  <section class="legal-hero">
    <div class="container">
      <span class="eyebrow">Legal</span>
      <h1 class="page-title chrome-text">Terms of Service</h1>
      <p class="last-updated">Last updated: May 2025</p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="legal-body">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="legal-content">
        <p class="lead">
          Please read these Terms of Service ("Terms") carefully before using the btdpodcast.net
          website (the "Site") operated by Behind the Door ("us," "we," or "our"). By accessing
          or using our Site, you agree to be bound by these Terms.
        </p>

        <h2>Acceptance of Terms</h2>
        <p>
          By accessing or using our Site, you confirm that you are at least 13 years of age,
          have read and understood these Terms, and agree to be bound by them. If you do not
          agree to these Terms, please do not use our Site.
        </p>

        <h2>Use of the Site</h2>
        <h3>Permitted Use</h3>
        <p>You may use the Site for lawful, personal, non-commercial purposes. You agree not to:</p>
        <ul>
          <li>Use the Site in any way that violates applicable local, state, national, or international law</li>
          <li>Copy, reproduce, or distribute any content from the Site without written permission</li>
          <li>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to any part of the Site</li>
          <li>Use any automated tools to scrape or harvest content from the Site</li>
          <li>Transmit any unsolicited commercial communications</li>
          <li>Impersonate Behind the Door, its hosts, or any other person or entity</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>Intellectual Property</h2>
        <p>
          The Site and its original content, features, and functionality are owned by Behind
          the Door and are protected by international copyright, trademark, patent, trade secret,
          and other intellectual property laws.
        </p>
        <p>
          The podcast name "Behind the Door," the BTD logo, and all related marks are trademarks
          of Behind the Door. You may not use these marks without our prior written consent.
        </p>

        <h2>Podcast Content</h2>
        <p>
          All podcast episodes, transcripts, show notes, and related audio and visual content
          are the intellectual property of Behind the Door. You may listen to and share episodes
          for personal, non-commercial purposes. You may not:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Download and redistribute podcast episodes for commercial purposes</li>
          <li>Create derivative works based on our content without permission</li>
          <li>Claim ownership of any of our podcast content</li>
          <li>Remove any copyright or proprietary notices from the content</li>
        </ul>

        <h2>User Submissions</h2>
        <p>
          When you submit information through our contact forms (including guest applications
          or sponsorship inquiries), you represent that all information provided is accurate
          and you have the right to provide it. We reserve the right to refuse any application
          or inquiry at our sole discretion.
        </p>
        <p>
          By submitting any content or information to us, you grant Behind the Door a
          non-exclusive, royalty-free, worldwide license to use, process, and store that
          information as necessary to respond to and manage your inquiry.
        </p>

        <h2>Third-Party Links</h2>
        <p>
          Our Site may contain links to third-party websites, including podcast platforms,
          social media, and sponsor websites. These links are provided for your convenience
          only. We have no control over the content of those sites and accept no responsibility
          for them or for any loss or damage that may arise from your use of them.
        </p>

        <h2>Disclaimer of Warranties</h2>
        <p>
          The Site is provided on an "as is" and "as available" basis without any warranties
          of any kind, either express or implied. We do not warrant that the Site will be
          uninterrupted or error-free, that defects will be corrected, or that the Site or
          the servers that make it available are free of viruses or other harmful components.
        </p>

        <h2>Limitation of Liability</h2>
        <p>
          To the fullest extent permitted by applicable law, Behind the Door shall not be
          liable for any indirect, incidental, special, consequential, or punitive damages,
          including but not limited to loss of profits, data, use, or goodwill, arising out
          of or in connection with your use of the Site.
        </p>

        <h2>Indemnification</h2>
        <p>
          You agree to defend, indemnify, and hold harmless Behind the Door and its affiliates,
          officers, agents, and employees from any claims, damages, obligations, losses,
          liabilities, costs, or debt arising from your use of the Site or your violation
          of these Terms.
        </p>

        <h2>Termination</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to terminate or restrict your access to the Site at any time,
          without notice, for any reason, including if we believe you have violated these Terms.
        </p>

        <h2>Changes to Terms</h2>
        <p>
          We reserve the right to modify these Terms at any time. Changes will be effective
          immediately upon posting to the Site. Your continued use of the Site after any changes
          constitutes your acceptance of the revised Terms. We encourage you to review this
          page periodically.
        </p>

        <h2>Governing Law</h2>
        <p>
          These Terms shall be governed by and construed in accordance with the laws of the
          United States, without regard to its conflict of law provisions. Any disputes
          arising under these Terms shall be subject to the exclusive jurisdiction of the
          courts located in the United States.
        </p>

        <h2>Contact Us</h2>
        <p>
          If you have questions about these Terms of Service, please contact us:
        </p>
        <ul>
          <li>Email: <a href="mailto:hello@btdpodcast.net">hello@btdpodcast.net</a></li>
          <li>Website: <a href="/contact">btdpodcast.net/contact</a></li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .container { max-width: 860px; margin: 0 auto; }

  .legal-hero {
    background: linear-gradient(160deg, var(--bg-alt), var(--bg-alt));
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem 3rem;
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    display: block;
    font-size: 0.7rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    letter-spacing: 0.2em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    margin-bottom: 0.75rem;
  }

  .page-title {
    font-size: clamp(1.75rem, 4vw, 2.75rem);
    font-weight: 900;
    margin: 0 0 0.5rem;
  }

  .chrome-text {
    color: var(--text);
  }

  .last-updated {
    color: var(--slate-grey);
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    margin: 0;
  }

  .legal-body {
    padding: 4rem 1.5rem 6rem;
  }

  .legal-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 1.25rem;
  }

  .lead {
    font-size: 1rem;
    color: var(--text-dim);
    line-height: 1.75;
    border-left: 3px solid var(--border);
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    margin-bottom: 0.5rem;
  }

  .legal-content h2 {
    font-size: 1.15rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    color: var(--text);
    margin-top: 1.5rem;
    padding-top: 1.5rem;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--border);
  }

  .legal-content h3 {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    color: var(--text-2);
  }

  .legal-content p {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    line-height: 1.75;
    font-size: 0.925rem;
  }

  .legal-content ul {
    list-style: none;
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0.4rem;
    padding: 0;
  }

  .legal-content ul li {
    color: var(--text-dim);
    font-size: 0.925rem;
    padding-left: 1.25rem;
    position: relative;
    line-height: 1.6;
  }

  .legal-content ul li::before {
    content: '—';
    position: absolute;
    left: 0;
    color: var(--border);
  }

  .legal-content a {
    color: var(--text-2);
    text-decoration: underline;
    text-decoration-color: var(--border);
    transition: color 0.2s;
  }

  .legal-content a:hover { color: var(--text-2); }
</style>
